<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">1 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wuntete wu Pawuli ku Timote</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wuntete ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wuntete Pawuli wu kasonika ku Timote.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli ku Listele kayenda mu kwe longa. Kwakoko kwedi zakalanga Timote. Ntangu yi kayuwa mambu ma Nzambi malonga Pawuli, yayoyo kalandila nzila yi Klisto. Bayenda yanandi mbala zizingi, na wusala mpe ha kimosi nandi .</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli bu kakwe yuwanga ti minkwikidi mi mbanza eyi mina teka Nzambi manima, hoti bu kakwe yuwanga ti dyambu dina luta koko, wuu na kifu kye tambikanga Timote mu kwe bahaana malongi. Wumutambika ku Efeso mu kwe syamisa minkwkidi mii koko. Mukanda bewuwu koko wuyenda mubata. Wumubambula moyo mu kwe teela baminkwikidi ti ba kikeba mu yuwa ndongolo zi yobobo bana longa mambu ma diswasani na Mambu Mambote. Wubwesa muteela bwedi baminkwikidi bafweni beela mu kati na mabundu, na bwedi bafweni sodila mintwadisi myawu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bwedi bufweni beela kizingu ki minkwkidi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:13">1.3–3.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Mi basweka mu nzila yi tulanda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 3:14-4:5">3.14–4.5</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Pawuli wuhaana Timote malongi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4:6-6:21">4.6–6.21</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Meno ni Pawuli, ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto mu lutumu lu Nzambi, Muvuukisi eto, na yi Yesu-Klisto, kivuvu kyeto.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Nasonikini ku ngeye, Timote, wuu mwana ani wukedika wu kiminu. Bika Nzambi Tata, na Yesu-Klisto Mfumu eto bakusakumuna, bakufwila nkenda na bakuhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawuli wuna kebisa milongisi mi luvunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Bonso bu nakusyamisa mu ntangu yi nedi kwenda ku kizunga ki Masedwani ti zakala mu mbanza Efeso, mwanki wukanikina bantu bana kwe longi ndongosolo zi luvunu. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Bateela balembolo ba bakangama mu bimpa na mu kinkulu ki makanda mawu bilembolo ba na nsukunu, na bikwe twalanga mbakani, ha kibuka kye sadila makani ma Nzambi, makwe lunganga mu kiminu. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Mfunu yi ntumunu beyoyo, ni mu yenikisa luzolo lukwe fumanga mu mutima wuvedila, mu mabanza mambote na mu kiminu kikedika. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Bantu bahiika, bateka nzila beyoyo manima, na bakangama kwawu mu binzonzi bibuzengi. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bana kibongila bonso milongisi mi Misiku mi Nzambi, kansi bakwe bakulanga mi bakwe tanga ko na myo mi bakwe zonzilanga na kivuvu kimvimba.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Tuzebi ti Misiku mimbote midi, tala ti mina sadulu bonso bufwanakani. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Tuzebi ti ka mu dyambu di bantu baa na nkadulu yi lunungu ko batuudila Misiku, kansi mu dyambu di bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbi na bakwe lembolo tumiminanga misiku, baa na mitima mimbi na minsumuki, bakwe lembolo vuminanga Nzambi na bima bilongo, yobobo bakwe hondanga matata mawu na zingudi zawu, mimpondi, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />bantu bakwe sadilanga kindumba, babakala bakwe vukisanga nitu yawu na yawu, bakwe tekanga zinkole, ba nga luvunu, bakwe dyanga ndefi zi luvunu, mpe mimvimba myomyo mikwe tingunanga ndongosolo yikedika. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Ndongosolo beyiyi yidi mu Musamu Wumbote wunkembo wufuma ku Nzambi yi mayangi, wu kampaana bonso kiyeko.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutudulu yi matondo mu bumbote bu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Nina vutula matondo ku Yesu-Klisto Mfumu eto, wumpaana ngolo zifwanakani mu sala kisalu kyani. Mu dyambu ti wuyena ti wufwanakana nidi mu sala kisalu kyandi. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Mpeleko mu ntama naba muntyaki, munkwamisi, muntu wu bituku. Kansi Nzambi wumfwila nkenda mu dyambu ti nedi zaba misamu mi nedi hidikanga ko, mpe naba na kiminu ko. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Mfumu eto wunyekisa mulemvo andi mu meno, wumpaana kiminu na luzolo bikwe fumanga mu kintwadi na Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Musamu bewuwu wufwanakani ti bamvimba batambula wo: Yesu-Klisto wuyiza mu nza mu vuukisa minsumuki. Meno ni wuntete ha kati dyawu. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Kansi, bwabobo Nzambi kamfwila nkenda. Wutya ti Yesu-Klisto kalonka luvibudulu lwandi lumvimba mu meno mpyokidi masumu mu minsumuki mimvimba. Kii bonso kifwani kimbote ku yobobo baasa kiminu kyawu mu yandi na baatambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Bika nzitusu na nkembo biba mimvu ka mimvu ku Ntinu yi ntangu zimvimba, Nzambi yikwe lembolo fwanga, yikwe lembolo yenikanga mpe yidi yimosi kaka! Ameni!<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Mwana ani Timote, ntumunu eyi nina kuhaana bonso mbikudulu zibabikula mu ngeye mu ntama. Bika zikuhaana kibakala, mwanki wunwana mvita yimbote, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />mu keba kiminu na mabanza mambote. Bantu bahiika babisa mu yuwa mina ta mabanza mawu, ni bahombisa kiminu kyawu. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Ha kati dyawu tuu na Imene na Alezandeli. Nabayekola mu moko ma satana mwanki balongoka mu lembolo tyaka Nzambi.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Ndongosolo mu dyambu di lusambulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Musamu wuntete tekila mimvimba, nina lusyamisa luhaananga ku Nzambi zindombolo, zinsambulu, ndilu mvutu na mvutudulu yi matondo mu dyambu di bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Tusambidilangeeno zintinu mpe na bantu bamvimba baa na kimfumu, mwanki tuba na luzingu luzuna, lukiyenge, lukivumi, mu kati di buzitu mpe mu ba batoma kangama mu Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Misamu myamyomyo mii mimbote na mikwe yangidikanga Nzambi Muvuukisi eto, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Nzambi tiidi ti bantu bamvimba bavuuka mpe biza ku nzayilu yikedika. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi yimosi kwandi yidi, mpe nzonzi yimosi kwandi yidi, yikwe vutulanga kikundi ha kati di Nzambi na bantu, ni Yesu-Klisto, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />wukiyekola yandi bende bonso munkayulu mu kuula bantu bamvimba. Kyo ni kimbangi Nzambi ki kalonka mu ntangu yi kakubika. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ni hahoho, (nina huna ko, makedika nina ta), Nzambi kansoodila mu ba mulongi, mpe ntumwa wufweti longa kiminu na kikedika ku balembolo ba Bayudayo.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Ni hahoho, ntiidi ti mu bibuka bimvimba babakala basambila, moko mavedila ku yulu, balembolo ba na mankesi na mpeve yi mayuma.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Bumosi mpe bakento, bafweti lwatanga binkutu bibuzitu, ndwatulu yifwanakani na yidedama. Ka balendi kangusungu milengi ko, balendi lwatanga misanga mi wola na mi palata ko, mpe binkutu bintalu ko, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />kansi bafweti hidikanga mavanga mambote, bonso bufwanakani ku bakento bakwe lonkanga ti bakwe vuminanga Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Bakento bafweti banga na swii mu ntangu yi ndongokolo, mpe mu kati di lutumumu. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Nina haana luve ku mukento ko mu longanga, na mu yaalanga bakala, kansi kafweti banga na swii. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi Adami kateka hidika, mboki Eva. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Ka Adami ko wuhunuka, kansi ni mukento. Bu kahunuka, wubisa mu tumimina Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Kansi mukento waavuuka mu mbutulu yi baala, tala ti waaba wukangama mu kiminu na luzolo, mpe waazinga mu bulongo na mu kivumi ki Nzambi.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Muntwadisi wu dibundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Musamu bewuwu wukedika wudi: tala ti muntu tiidi mu ba muntwadisi wu dibundu, kisalu kimbote kidi. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Muntwadisi wu dibundu kalendi ba na dyambu dye musembila ko, na kaba bakala di mukento wumosi kaka. Fweti ba muntu wuludedomo, wuu na mpisulu, na wuu na nkadulu yi fwanakani. Fweti toma zaba mu bwananga zinzenza mpe kaba na lulendo lwe longila. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Ka bandi kinkolo mbungu ko, ka muntu wu bikindu ko, kansi fweti ba muntu wu kizunu na wu kiyenge. Mpe ka bandi na nzodi yi mbongo! <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Fweti zaaba mu twadisa nzo andi bumbote mpe fweti sa ti baala bandi baba na lutumumu mpe na kivumi kimvimba. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Kansi tala ti muntu kazebi mu twadisa nzo andi ko, bwedi kalenda twadisila dibundu di Nzambi e? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Kalendi ba muntu wumoona wuviludi ka ntama ko madyela, nganunu wuna ba muntu wu mayama, mpe ku nsukunu kabedoso bonso nkadyampemba. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Bafweti muteela kimbangi kimbote ku bantu balembolo ba mu Klisto, mwanki balembolo munyafuna, na kalembolo bwa mu mitambu mi nkadyampemba.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Bumosi mpe, bisadi bi dibundu bifweti ba bantu ba kivumi, mpe baba na kikedika mu nzonzolo awu. Babandi binkolo mbungu, na ka basosangandi mu baka mbongo mu nzila zimbi ko. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Bafweti ba bakangama mu kikedika ki kiminu mu kati di mabanza mambote. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Bufwanakani mu teka bameka(kusinsa), ku manima, basala kwawu bonso bisadi, tala ti kuu na dyambu dye basembila ko. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Bumosi mpe, bakento bafweti ba bantu bakivumi, balembolo ba na matoola, bafweti ba na ludedomo mpe bafweti ba bakwikama mu mimvimba. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Kisadi kafweti ba bakala di mukento wumosi kaka, mpe fweti zaaba mu twadisa bumbote baala bandi na nzo andi yimvimba. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Mu dyambu ti, bisadi byo bikwe toma salanga bumbote kisalu kyawu, bantu bamvimba bakwe toma bazitisanga, mpe bakwe banga na kivuvu kikinene mu kiminu kyawu mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mansweki mamanene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Nina kusonikina mukanda bewuwu na kivuvu kye luyena munswalu. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Tala ti nina tumbu kwiza ko, zaba bwedi bwe dyatila mu nzo-Nzambi, dibundu di Nzambi yimoyo, kunzi na musinguku wu kikedika. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Wukedika ti, mansweki me ba makangama mu Nzambi mamanene madi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Klisto wukiyenikisa bonso muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">wuyenokoso wulunungu ku Mpeve yilongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">wuyenika ku zimbazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Bamusamuna ku bantu ba nsi zihiika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Bantu mu nza yimvimba bakwikila mu yandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Mpe Nzambi wumuzangula mu nkembo.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bimvimba bihidika Nzambi bimbote bidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Mpeve Yilongo yitoma bangula ti: mu ntangu yi nsukunu, bantu bazimbisa kiminu, mu landa mpeve zi luvunu mpe na ndongosolo zimpeve zimbi. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Baabazimbisa ku bantu baa na luvunu na banga diisu ku nsye lukaya, mabanza mawu meka mambi bonso kisengo kimeni benga ku tiya, maabwesa swasikisa mbi na mbote ko. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Bantu bebobo bana kanikina bantu mu kwela na mu dya bindya bihiika. Kansi ni Nzambi wuhidika byo, mwanki minkwikidi mizebi kikedika, bu bavutudi matondo, badidi byo. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Mu dyambu ti bima bimvimba bihidika Nzambi bimbote bidi. Kunaani kima ki balendi loosa, kansi lufweti tambula byo mu kati di mvutudulu yi matondo, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />mu dyambu ti Mambu ma Nzambi na lusambulu lu ndilu mvutu bakwe byekanga byo.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisadi ki mbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Tala ti longidi mimvimba bemimi ku zimpangi, waaba kisadi kimbote ki Yesu-Klisto, kwe dikulungu mambu ma kiminu na mu ndongosolo yimbote yi wutoma landa. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Kansi, bisa bimpa bi buzengi, bilembolo fwanakana na kiminu. Ngeye fweti banga wukangama mu Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Kusakidikisanga nitu kuu ndandu mu bima bibingi ko, kansi mu banga wukangama mu Nzambi mu na ndandu mu bimvimba. Mu dyambu ti, muu na nsilulu zi luzingu lu bubedidi na luna kwiza. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Mambu bemama makedika madi mpe bantu bamvimba bafweni tambula mo. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Tala ti tukwe sanga ngolo na tukwe nwananga, mu dyambu ti tutuula kivuvu kyeto mu Nzambi yi moyo, wudi Muvuukisi yi bantu bamvimba, sungula minkwikidi.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Mambu mamomo fweti toma zabikisa ku bantu na ku balonga mo. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Kani muntu kasafulandi kintwenya kyaku ko! Kansi fweti ba kifwani kimbote ku minkwikidi, mu mpova, mu ndyatulu, mu luzolo, mu kiminu na mu ku vedila. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Tekila niza, fweti sa kimfuzi mu tangilanga minkwikidi Mambu ma Nzambi, mu basyamisa, na mu balonga. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Kunyafunandi munkayulu aku wu wutambula mu mulemvo wu Nzambi ko, mu ntangu yibikula mimbikudi na bakuluntu ba dibundu bu bedi kutentika moko. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Sadila myo mu mutima aku wumvimba, kihaana mvimba mu kisalu kyaku, mwanki bamvimba bayena bwedi wuna kwendila ku mutwala. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Kikenga ngebende na ndongosolo aku. Tatamana mu nzila beyoyo. Mu dyambu ti mu sadila bobo, wuna kivuukisa ngebende na bantu bana kuyuwa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ndwengosolo zitadidi minkwikidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Kusembandi kinunu mu nkasu ko, kansi mu syamisa bonso tata. Syamisa zintwenya bonso zimpangi, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />bakento banuna bonso zingudi mpe zindumba bonso bibusi, mu mutima wuvedila.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Zitisa mafoola maa nkatika mafoola. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Tala ti mufwidi wuu na baala hoti batekolo, yawu bafweti teka lonka ki Nzambi kyawu mu sadisa makanda mawu. Mpe bavutula ku bibuti byawu byo bi batambula ku yawu. Mu dyambu ti nsadulu beyoyo yikwe yangidikanga Nzambi. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Foola dikedika ni dyodyodyo di siidi dyahiika, tuudidi kivuvu kyandi mu Nzambi na kwe tatamananga mpimpa na mwini mu nzindombolo na mu zinsambulu. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Kansi foola bedyodyo dikwe zinganga mu mikembo mi nza, difwa didi mpeleko wumoyo kadi. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Babambula moyo misamu bemyomyo, mwanki balembolo basemba. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Tala ti muntu kana sadisa bantu baa mukanda dyandi ko, sungula bantu baa mu nzo andi, yandi bwisidi kiminu mpe vudidi bubi na muntu wulembolo ba munkwikidi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Mu sonika foola mu mukanda, ka fweti ba bela-bela na makumasambanu ma mvula. Mpe kaba mukento wuba wu kwelo ku bakala dimosi, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />bafweti muteela kimbangi mu bisalu byandi bimbote: wukudisa baala bandi, kubwana zinzenza, kusukula malu ma bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, kusadisa bantu baa mu mpasi na kusosa mu hidika misamu mimbote.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Mu myo mitadidi mafoola ma ntwenya, kubasonikandi mu mukanda ko. Mu dyambu ti, bu babaka nsatu ze kwela dyaka, babisa Klisto, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />mpe bafundusu mu dyambu ti bazitisi ndefi awu yintete yibadya ko. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Tala ti basidi dyaka na kisalu ko, bayambukidi mu nzo ka nzo, beka mazonza-zonza mpe basidi na mansweki ko mu misamu milembolo ba myawu. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Ni hahoho ntiidi ti, mafoola ma ntwenya mabwesa kwela, mabuta baala, matwadisa nzo zawu bumbote, mwanki malembolo haana nzila ku mutantu mu tuzonzila bumbi. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Mu dyambu ti, mafoola mahiika mazimbakani nzila yimbote mu landa Satana. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Tala ti munkwikidi wu mukento wuu na mafoola mu kanda dyandi, bika kabasadisa, na kayekolandi kizitu ku dibundu ko, mwanki dibundu disadisa mafoola malembolo ba na nsadisi.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Bakuluntu ba dibundu bakwe twadisanga bumbote, bafweni mu baka mufutu nkumbu zole, sungula yobobo bakwe tovokanga mu longa Mambu ma Nzambi na mu haana ndongosolo. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Mu dyambu ti Masonama mana ta ebu: «kukangandi munwa wu ngombe yina sala mu yonzika mbutu ko», mpe «kisadi fweni baka mufutu andi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Dt 25.4 na 1Kol 9.9; Mat 10.10; Luk 10.7. </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Kutambulangandi bafunda mu kuluntu wu dibundu ko, tala ti ka ha ntadisi yi mbangi zole hoti zitatu ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dt 19.15.</char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Tala ti bantu bahodidi masumu, basembila ha ntadisi yi bantu bamvimba, mwanki bahiika mpe bayena bunkuta.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Nina kulomba ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, yi Yesu-Klisto na ha ntadisi yi zimbazi zisoolo, mu vumina Misiku bemimi, ka mu swasikisa bantu ko na kubandi na ntalu ha zizi ko. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Kutentikangandi moko mu nswalu ku muntu ko, kukotangandi mu masumu ma bantu bahiika ko. Ngebende fweti banga wuvedila.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Bika mu nwa kaka mamba, kansi nwanga mpe mwa ndambu vinu mu dyambu di mputa kivumu na bimbevo bihiika. <verse eid="1TI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Masumu ma bantu bahiika makwe yenikanga makedika tekila babafundisa, kansi ku bahiika makwe yenikanga ku manima. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Bumosi mpe, mavanga mambote makwe yenikanga, na momo mpe malembolo ba mambote makwe tatamananga mu ba maswekama ko.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Bantu bamvimba baa ku nsye bundongo, bafweti bongilanga zimfumu zawu bonso bantu bafwanakani mu tambula kivumi kimvimba, mwanki balembolo vweza nkumbu yi Nzambi na ndongosolo eto. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Mindongo mii na mfumu zi minkwikidi, balendi bika mu bavumina ko mu dyambu ti bubadi zimpangi zawu. kansi bafweti toma basadila bumbote, mu dyambu ti yobobo ba bana sadila minkwikidi midi mpe mpangi zawu zizola.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Ndongosolo yilembolo fwanakana</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Myamyomyo fweti longa mpe fweti batuma. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Tala ti muntu wuna longa malongi maswaswana, mpe tatukidi na mambu mavedila ma mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto mpe na ndongosolo yifwanakana mu ba wukangama mu Nzambi, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />weka mpofo mu dyambu di mayama, kazebi dyaka kima ko, weka na kimbevo kye bakana na kye yumana. Bwabobo bukwe toninanga nzinunu, mayuma, bituku, mbanzulu zimbi, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />mpe mbakani zikwe lembolo manisanga, ha kati di bantu baa na mpeve yi kitombe mpe balembolo ba na kikedika. Bakwe banzilanga ti kiminu mu Nzambi kyeka nzila ye vwamina.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ninga, ndandu yiyinene yidi mu ba wukangama mu Nzambi, tala ti muntu wuna yangalala mu byo bii nandi. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Mu dyambu ti, bu tuyiza mu nza, tuyiza na kima ko, mpe bu twaakatuka, twaanata kima ko. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Ni hahoho, tala ti tuu na bindya mpe na binkutu, bufweni. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Kansi ku yobobo bakwe sosanga mu vwama, bakwe bwanga mu ntontolo, mu mutambu na mu zinzinunu zizingi zimbi na zi buzengi. Zazozo zikwe bebisanga muntu na zikwe natanga ku lufwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Mu dyambu ti, nzodi yi mbongo ni mwanzi wu mambi mamvimba. Bahiika bu balanda zo, batatuka kukula na kiminu, na banata nkwamusu mu nitu zi yawu bende.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ku Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Kansi ngeye muntu wu Nzambi, tina bima bebyobyo. Sosa lunungu, mu ba wukangama mu Nzambi, kiminu, luzolo, mvibudulu na lembami. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Nwana mvita yimbote yi kiminu, baka moyo wu mimvu ka mimvu, wu wutambudila mbokolo yi wuteela kimbangi kimbote ha ntadisi yi zimbangi zizingi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ha ntadisi yi Nzambi kwe haananga luzingu ku bima bimvimba, na ha ntadisi yi Yesu-Klisto wuta kimbangi mu nzonzolo yimbote ha ntadisi yi Ponso Pilatu, nina kutuma ti: <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Zitisa mwina wu wutambula, ba wulembolo ba na dyambu dimbi na kibila mu keba wo natee mu kilumbu kyaayenika Mfumu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Ni Nzambi waayenikisa Klisto mu ntangu yi kakubika. Yandi wudi nto yi mayangi, Mfumu yakwa yimosi, Ntinu yi zintinu, na Mfumu yi zimfumu. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Yandi kwandi kwe lembolo fwanga, mpe kwe zinganga mu kya kidi ti muntu kalendi finama ko. Kunaani muntu wumuyena na lenda muyena. Bika nzitusu na lulendo biba ku yandi, mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malongi ku bamvwama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Teela ku mvwama zi ha nza beyiyi balembolo ba na mayama, na balembolo tuula kivuvu kyawu mu bimvwama bikwe fwanga. Kansi batuula kivuvu kyawu mu Nzambi, kwe tuhaananga bima bimvimba mu kitezo kihyokidi, mwanki tuyenina byo kyese. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Bateela bahidika misamu mimbote, baba zimvwama mu mavanga mambote, baba na nyambu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyambu, ni muntu bewowo wulembolo ba na moko ngolo, muntu wukwe kabulanga</char></note> mpe bakabudilanga bahiika. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Ni bwabobo, baayonzikila kimvwama kimbote na kisikila mu ntangu yina kwiza, mwanki babaka luzingu lukedika.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumunu zimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timote, toma keba misamu mi bakuteela. Tina nzonzolo zimpamba na zilembolo fwanakana na kiminu, mpe tina ndongosolo zii nzayilu zimbi. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Bantu batambudila nzonzolo bezozo, basotoka mu kiminu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Bika mulemvo wu Nzambi wuba neeno kintwadi!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>